  "notes": [
    "Each entry represents one hit unless stated otherwise. Trigger availability and buff duration are combat snapshots, not a rotation simulation.",
    "Press fires two paws and Hold five; entries show one paw, not a multiplied total. Revelation fires three additional paws per trigger, with the same Skill damage scaling.",
    "Shield absorption, healing, charge speed, movement, stamina and enemy ATK reduction are described separately from outgoing damage. C6’s 200 EM requires strictly above 50% recipient HP.",
    "Radiance is an external-state snapshot and cannot be both Conduct and Swirl. C6’s reaction bonuses do not require high HP, do require the actual field, and never increase ordinary Cryo or Lunar damage.",
    "Stellar Swirl selectors also cover future authored direct Stellar Swirl hits; this character does not generate direct Stellar damage itself."
  ],
